OL,3,GNEWSAWhy the battle for the green belt
OL,4,Amatters so much to communities across
OL,5,Athe country
OL,6,
OL,7,FAcross the country, the signs have gone
OL,8,Fup in dozens of locations along the
OL,9,Fsame theme: "Save Our Green Belt".
OL,11,FYet ministers insist more homes must be
OL,12,Fbuilt, councils warn they have little
OL,13,Fchoice and developers argue that parts
OL,14,Fof the green belt are no longer the
OL,15,Funtouched countryside many imagine.
OL,17,F"We don't need these lovely fields and
OL,18,Fpastures covered in concrete."
